<title>FRANCE: Postal traffic at ADP down in Sept up for 9 months.</title>
<headline>Postal traffic at ADP down in Sept up for 9 months.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postal traffic handled at the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly, last month totalled 10,305 tonnes, down 3.7 percent on September 1995, airport authority figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>January-September 1996 postal traffic handled at the two airports totalled 94,699 tonnes, an increase of 3.2 percent on the same period last year.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
